  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yearly Contribution for the FAO Liaison Office in Moscow (Office Rent and Operating Expenses)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In February 2015, the Russian Federation and FAO signed an Agreement for the establishment of the FAO Liaison Office in Moscow. This Agreement envisages that the Russian Federation provides  and  annual contribution to cover the cost of office supplies, general operating expenses and Office rent.</narrative>
